    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MURPHY MULLAN are delighted to present this fantastic two bedroomed house to the market. Set in a small development off Blackhorse Avenue. This property is sure to appeal to firs time buyers and downsizers alike.  \r\n\r\nThe location is simply superb with the Phoenix Park on its door step providing both country and city living in the heart of Dublin with stunning walks and scenery.  There are excellent local schools and a host of shops and necessary amenities. With an excellent public transport system to and from Dublin City Centre with both the N3 and M50 close by providing easy access to most route ways.  Broombridge green luas line is only 15 minutes’ walk making many locations easily accessible.\r\n\r\nWell-proportioned accommodation downstairs includes hallway, living room, kitchen and conservatory. Upstairs two double bedrooms and main bathroom.  \r\n\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway:\tCarpeted\r\nLiving Room / Dining: Carpeted.Feature fireplace with wood surround\r\nKitchen: Fully tiled gallery kitchen with cream kitchen presses top and bottom\r\nBedroom 1: Carpeted/ Double bedroom with built in wardrobes\r\nBedroom 2:  Carpeted / Double bedroom with built in wardrobes and vanity unit. \r\nMain bathroom: Fully tiled bathroom / shower  / WHB / WC / Velux window\r\nOutside:\r\nFront:  Front driveway. Part Lawned\r\nRear: Mainly lawned, part patio area. Steel garden shed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Highly Sought After, Mature Residential Area\r\nPhoenix Park on your doorstep\r\nGas fires Central Heating\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nConservatory\r\nBroombridge Luas Green Line 10 min drive\r\nStoneybatter/Smithfield Red Luas Line 10/15 min drive\r\nDublin City Centre approx 15mins by bus\r\nHost of excellent local Primary and Secondary schools"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D"
      }
